      "reason": "等しい (hitoshii) is an i-adjective that more broadly and naturally covers the general meaning of 'equal' (e.g., equal in quantity, value, or degree) for a general learner. Its JMdict glosses include 'equal; similar; like; same; equivalent,' making it a more comprehensive and natural fit than 同一 for the general English lemma 'equal'."
